---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Alicia" description="Lifelong Utah resident, bilingual REALTOR® and past President of the Tooele County Association of REALTORS®.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Hi, I'm <em>Alicia.</em></h1></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap cols body">
    <img src="/images/alicia-sofa.jpg" alt="Alicia Unruh seated in a living room" class="photo" width="682" height="1024" />
    <div>
      <p>I love how real estate connects me with the lives of others: their stories, passions, dreams and journeys. One of the most rewarding parts of being a REALTOR® is walking alongside new friends as they take a big next step in life and watching the freedom and excitement that comes with homeownership.</p>
      <p>As a lifelong Utah resident, I know and love Utah and all that it has to offer. Born in Cache County, raised in Weber and Davis Counties, and having spent my adult years living and working throughout Davis, Salt Lake, Utah and Tooele Counties, I bring a broad knowledge of the communities and lifestyles that make Utah such a wonderful place to call home. I now call the Heber Valley home, in Summit and Wasatch Counties.</p>
      <p>If you're looking for a REALTOR® who understands the different areas and can help you discover which one is the right fit for your next chapter, you've found the right person.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap narrow2">
    <p>I'm skilled at navigating every step of buying and selling. Whether you're a first-time homebuyer, new to the state, ready to sell and move into your next chapter, leaving Utah for a new adventure, or somewhere in between, I'm here to help. My knowledge of Utah's communities, combined with an understanding of the many details involved in a transaction, lets me complement your vision with the guidance you need to move forward with confidence.</p>
    <p>With a great team behind me, I'll journey with you through your next adventure, providing the information, knowledge, communication and guidance you need along the way. My goal is to take the fear and unknown out of the process so you can focus on what really matters: the exciting next step in your life.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap cols fam">
    <div>
      <h2>Rooted here, wherever home is.</h2>
      <div class="cred-cards">
        <div><b>Past President</b>Tooele County Association of REALTORS®</div>
        <div><b>Member</b>Park City Board of REALTORS® and TCAR</div>
        <div><b>Bilingual</b>Fluent in English and Spanish</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/alicia-and-jason.jpg" alt="Alicia with her husband" class="photo" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" />
  </section>
  <div class="narrow cta-end"><a href="/contact" class="btn">Let's talk about your next chapter</a></div>
</Base>

<style>
  .body{padding:4rem 0;align-items:start}
  .body img{max-width:420px}
  .narrow2{width:min(760px,92vw);margin:0 auto;padding-bottom:3rem}
  .fam{padding:3rem 0 4rem}
  .cred-cards{display:grid;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.4rem}
  .cred-cards div{border-left:4px solid var(--clay);padding:.4rem 1rem;background:#fff8}
  .cred-cards b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem}
  .cta-end{text-align:center;padding:1rem 0 4rem}
</style>
